WEBVTT

00:02.800 --> 00:06.080
Now we can only trust them

00:09.560 --> 00:10.400
Your Highness

00:10.480 --> 00:12.240
The western neighbor seems to be moving

00:12.320 --> 00:14.040
How can Your Highness suppress this news

00:14.120 --> 00:16.080
And not let His Majesty recall troops to defend

00:16.160 --> 00:17.280
Minister Xue

00:17.360 --> 00:19.400
Father has planned this battle for half his life

00:19.480 --> 00:21.147
You have no solid evidence

00:21.760 --> 00:23.720
How can I issue such an order?

00:23.800 --> 00:25.000
We're not afraid of the unlikely

00:25.120 --> 00:27.400
But the one in ten thousand, Your Highness

00:27.480 --> 00:30.200
If we wait for solid evidence before sending troops

00:30.280 --> 00:31.947
Wouldn't it be too late?

00:32.800 --> 00:34.560
Your Highness is considerate of the Emperor

00:34.640 --> 00:36.480
But now the country's defenses are empty

00:36.560 --> 00:38.227
If the enemy truly invades

00:38.320 --> 00:39.520
And we suffer defeat

00:39.600 --> 00:42.267
Will His Majesty be considerate of Your Highness?

00:44.040 --> 00:45.880
There were heavy rains in the southern border

00:45.960 --> 00:47.800
Which reduced your embezzlement by a bit

00:47.880 --> 00:49.960
So you can't do this job anymore?

00:50.040 --> 00:52.680
Minister Xue, do you think I'm young and easy to bully

00:52.760 --> 00:54.240
And know nothing?

00:55.280 --> 00:58.600
Your Highness, everything I do is for Great Xuan

00:59.080 --> 01:01.720
Your servant is willing to remonstrate with death

01:02.040 --> 01:03.160
Minister Xue, you mustn't

01:03.320 --> 01:04.520
Your Highness

01:04.600 --> 01:07.600
We cannot treat Great Xuan's fate as a game

01:24.560 --> 01:26.200
Lady Chen, what brings you here?

01:26.280 --> 01:28.240
Since Minister Xue wants to remonstrate with death

01:28.320 --> 01:29.720
Go help him

01:29.800 --> 01:31.200
Yes

01:38.720 --> 01:39.440
Chen Wan'er

01:39.520 --> 01:40.200
You

01:40.280 --> 01:41.560
You

01:41.640 --> 01:44.280
You dare kill a senior minister in the Taiji Hall

01:44.360 --> 01:47.693
Do you really think His Majesty will tolerate you later?

01:50.400 --> 01:51.800
Whether he tolerates me

01:52.560 --> 01:55.160
Is a matter between His Majesty and me as husband and wife

01:55.240 --> 01:56.720
You're old

01:57.880 --> 01:59.240
Still so nosy

02:12.400 --> 02:14.480
The Crown Prince is overseeing the court

02:14.560 --> 02:16.560
His Majesty is personally leading the campaign

02:16.640 --> 02:19.920
My son has the courage to fight on the front lines

02:20.000 --> 02:21.440
The Chen family is not panicking

02:21.520 --> 02:22.680
Gentlemen

02:22.760 --> 02:24.427
What are you panicking about?

02:26.360 --> 02:28.560
The decisive battle between Great Xuan and Wuzhao

02:28.640 --> 02:30.307
Is in these few days

02:30.760 --> 02:33.840
You gentlemen shall stay in the palace as guests

02:34.480 --> 02:37.040
I will personally host you

02:39.800 --> 02:41.467
Before the battle is settled

02:42.320 --> 02:44.160
Anyone who passes through this gate

02:44.240 --> 02:45.640
Kill

02:45.800 --> 02:47.800
Those who speak cunningly of retreat

02:47.880 --> 02:48.800
Kill

02:48.880 --> 02:50.560
Those who harm the state for personal gain

02:50.640 --> 02:52.040
Kill

02:53.960 --> 02:55.320
Yes

03:06.240 --> 03:08.000
Raise my royal banner in the formation

03:08.080 --> 03:09.747
Send all the imperial guard

03:09.880 --> 03:10.720
Today

03:10.800 --> 03:12.800
We must not let him escape

03:13.040 --> 03:14.440
Yes

03:21.800 --> 03:23.040
Imperial Guard

03:23.120 --> 03:24.640
Follow me and kill

03:25.480 --> 03:30.080
Kill

03:46.480 --> 03:47.880
Sikong Yao

03:47.960 --> 03:50.960
Today is the life-and-death battle between you and me

03:51.080 --> 03:52.480
Report

03:53.040 --> 03:53.480
My King

03:53.560 --> 03:54.280
Something's wrong

03:54.360 --> 03:55.720
Xuan troops are attacking from behind

03:55.800 --> 03:56.720
Cutting off our retreat

03:56.800 --> 03:58.200
What?

04:04.480 --> 04:06.813
Follow me to cut off their retreat

04:48.280 --> 04:49.680
Brother

04:50.240 --> 04:51.640
Let's retreat

04:52.080 --> 04:53.747
I fell into an ambush

04:54.000 --> 04:56.333
This time, I fell into an ambush

04:57.120 --> 04:58.520
Let's regroup

05:00.800 --> 05:02.200
Brother

05:02.400 --> 05:03.800
Brother

05:05.240 --> 05:06.000
Brother

05:06.080 --> 05:08.400
If not for you, for your son

05:08.480 --> 05:09.640
Not following my orders

05:09.720 --> 05:11.320
And engaging the enemy on your own

05:11.400 --> 05:13.920
How could we have come to this today?

05:14.000 --> 05:14.760
Brother

05:14.840 --> 05:15.480
Don't

05:15.560 --> 05:18.240
My empire was destroyed by you

05:18.760 --> 05:20.160
Brother

05:22.720 --> 05:24.000
Recall the vanguard

05:24.080 --> 05:25.440
Break through from the rear

05:25.520 --> 05:26.480
Yes

